  "verdict": "not_justified",
  "protocol_steps": [
    {
      "step": "Threshold: Tribunal competence",
      "finding": "A court is competent to review whether an act of killing falls within the doctrine of necessary defense of others. This is a question of law and fact, not political preference. The Tribunal may identify whether the conditions for justification were met."
